{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"舞台  こち亀も"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気づけば明日東京千秋楽ですっ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"早いな〜早いな〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんか、切ないな〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっと自分の中で落ち着いて出来るようになってきたのに〜(´；ω；｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"舞台ってすごいですねっ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎日自分が舞台に立つ時、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"袖でみんなのお芝居を観ている時、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎日違うから、毎日お勉強出来ますヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"改めて、こち亀が私にもたらした事は相当デカイのだと。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"このインプットはすごいよっ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この時期のインプットは有難い"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/09/18/9937135/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/09/18/9937135/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日のマチソワ間に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"石井さんがカレーをふるまって下さいましたっ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"美味しかった〜ヽ(・∀・)ノ⭐️⭐️"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幸せに包まれました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/09/18/9937135/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさん優しいお兄ちゃんお姉ちゃんですっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/09/18/9937135/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/09/18/9937135/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みて、この安心しきった顔"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/09/18/9937135/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/09/18/9937135/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ロビーの縁日に武者先輩といったよヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/09/18/9937135/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"髪の毛長い方の女性えっちゃんヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"えっちゃんに毎日声出しから歌を見てもらっていますヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おかげで、前より歌えるようになってきたヽ(・∀・)ノ⭐️⭐️"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎日ありがとうございますっ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スタッフさんも、いつもマイクや、舞台を動かして下さったり、照明をつけて下さったり、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アドバイス下さったりありがとうございますっ(´；ω；｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/09/18/9937135/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"のんちゃん、よーこちゃんが来てくれたよ〜ヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は亮介くんも来てくれたよヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コープスファミリーありがとうっヽ(・∀・)ノ⭐️⭐️"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さ、明日の為に寝ますっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"へばなっ☆彡"}],"source":"archive"}